{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>Awesome</b> — then they will see the fear of HaShem and His might upon them." "<b>For He has made lean</b> — a past-tense verb, from the paradigm of רזי לי (\"they became lean\"), like משמן בשרו ירזה. After HaShem has made lean and cut off all the gods of the earth, and every man has bowed down to HaShem — from his place he will bow down to Him at the beginning of the matter."], :book :zephaniah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {1 "The phrase ממקומו ישתחוו לו תחלת עניין is opaque; rendered hyper-literally without smoothing."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zephaniah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zfanya"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:47:21.331413287Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}